rota lap 4620, row 1 -- Air, the row that feels; hand-advanced past row 0, read twice on this shelf already. Its instruction is to walk the fence line and press every post, and its fixed seat says a part stands free only if pulling on it moves nothing else.
think Round opened on the anointed order at 975f93748e, cold roster pass launched detached through standing_equipment_run.sh --detach so the transcript names itself.
think Cold pass: 253 guards run, 250 green, 1 red, 2 gated, tree_moved=no. The red is standing_equipment itself reading dated_path off the run card -- REDS %626, a cadence guard whose ceiling no lap may lower, OPEN and surfaced as a gate on Keaton's word. Nothing agent-closable, so reds-first is satisfied by naming it.
think First post pressed: the DOOR roster of tools/fixtures/p/prose_register_scan.sh is 19 hand-typed paths while the tree holds 115 living front doors. The post held -- the scan already walks every tracked README.md, holds it to the same eight-sentence floor, and prints front_doors, front_doors_readable, front_doors_unrostered_over with one candidate: line each. 120 doors read, the blind spot carrying a live number rather than a sentence somebody typed once.
think Second post gave. tools/fixtures/t/two_rooms_doorway_scan.rish reads living_silent=90 since last lap opened that ceiling, and 23 of the 90 are living pages of context/ -- the room where TWO_ROOMS.md itself lives. The dated half of that room was repaired at %642; its living half had never been read at all, because the stampless exemption stood over exactly those pages until last lap removed it.
think Each of the 23 was read and judged from its body rather than its title, then given a **Room:** line beneath the front matter: 6 checkable where a witness or a rule file binds every claim, 8 mixed where a counted half stands beside a judged one, 9 vision where a voice or a discipline is held by taste. The second key rather than an appended Status token, because a Status here carries links and parity pins and a token appended to one lands inside a citation -- the same reasoning the context/specs repair recorded.
obs Three of the 23 are mirrored documents declared in context/document-mirrors.brix, so editing the canonical alone would have reddened document_mirror on the next pass. sh tools/fixtures/d/document_mirror_scan.sh write carried the line to ember-voices/KYRI.md, spellbook/README.md and biochemistry/README.md, and the witness proves all three byte-identical.
obs context/ reads 99 pages and 0 living-silent. The living ceiling falls 90 to 67 with zero slack; fails=3 and the dated ceiling stand unmoved, which is what a repair confined to one class looks like.
obs The door this lap used is %642's own ruling, one reading deeper: a remainder standing whole reads as a gate, and the same remainder partitioned by room is a lap. 73 dated pages were the gate that row dissolved; 90 living pages were this one.
